			"Message": "feat(Output): Resolve workbench services up-front in transform plugin\n\nEnhance the ExposeWorkbenchAccessor ESBuild transform to pre-resolve concrete service instances during workbench startup, not just expose the raw IInstantiationService. The transform now creates globalThis.__CEL_SERVICES__ with three pre-bound services:\n\n- Statusbar (via IStatusbarService)\n- Commands (via ICommandService)\n- CommandRegistry (direct module access)\n\nThis allows Sky-side bridge code to call method surfaces directly without re-entering the workbench's AMD loader. All three symbols are available in the stock web.main.js closure via the bundler's require map. Wrapped in a try-catch so a rename in upstream VS Code does not wedge boot - the raw instantiation service above still covers the fallback path.\n\nRefs a15387c29c3ea0495a9b3f060d0da6ad13632eb2",
			"SHA": "354c448c4413ff1695609def7b4183e76c3403fe"
		},
		{
			"Author": "Auto",
			"Date": "2026-04-24T03:26:33Z",
			"File": [
				"⠀⠀⠀⠀⠀",
